## Problem

`npx skills update` only works for globally installed skills (`-g` flag). Project-scoped skills are not tracked in the lock file (`~/.agents/.skill-lock.json`), so `npx skills check` and `npx skills update` silently skip them.

## Root Cause (from source analysis)

In `cli.mjs`, `addSkillToLock` is only called when `installGlobally === true`:

```javascript
// ~line 2092
if (successful.length > 0 && installGlobally) try {
    // ...
    await addSkillToLock(remoteSkill.installName, { ... });
} catch {}
```

Meanwhile, `runCheck()` and `runUpdate()` only read the global lock file:
